Photos for the "Beyond the Code" section go in this folder.

Drop image files here, then list them in that entry's `photos` array
near the top of app.js:

  photos: [
    { src: "assets/beyond/aws-bootcamp-01.jpg", cap: "Cloud bootcamp, PUP Manila" },
    { src: "assets/beyond/aws-bootcamp-02.jpg", cap: "Mentoring session" },
  ]

One photo or many — the card badge, gallery and lightbox all adapt.
Keep files under ~300 KB each so the page stays fast.
